# The guard of gathers() fails on a parsed record, so its slow version runs. The turn of its loop holds no operator on numbers, no relation, no equality and no join of texts: only a call. The step of the for-of at the head of the loop
# is itself something to reckon: the slow version is walked, not written straight, and asks what it iterates whether it is a list as made.
